  "description": "For 2019, the Solum i/O brings Haro's vaunted Rider Tuned Geometry to the pedelec category. Designed from the ground up to be the ultimate sporty eBike, the Solum i/O is equally at home crushing your commute, unpaved lake roads, or that rails to trails route on the weekend. Shimano's STePS e6100 center-drive motor system provides assistance up to 20 miles per hour, and its 418eH battery provides you with up to a 60 mile range depending on mode selected. Shimano's 1x10 drivetrain is simple and efficient and allows you to get from here to there without even breaking a sweat. Solum i/O has full rack and fender mounts, Haro commuter saddle with a micro adjust seat post, and Shimano M200 hydraulic brakes provide reliable stops in all weather conditions.\nLightweight 6061 aluminum i/O-specific frame with Haro's proven Rider Tuned Geometry\nSmooth Shimano STePS e6100 motor w/418eH battery for up to 60 mile range\nSR Suntour NEX HLO suspension fork with 63mm travel and hydraulic lockout\nShimano 10-spd Deore drivetrain\nNew Pivit alloy 9* sweep riser bar, and forged stem\nShimano MT201 hydraulic disc brakes\nFast-rolling Kenda Kwick Drumlin 700c X 38mm all-purpose tires\nReady for anything with an alloy rack & fenders\nFront & rear lights",
